-- title:
--   expandₚ makes R[X_σ] finite flat of rank p^{|σ|}
-- statement:
--   Let $R$ be a commutative ring, let $\sigma$ be a finite type, and let $p$ be a natural number with $0 < p$. Consider the $R$-algebra endomorphism `MvPolynomial.expand p` of the polynomial ring $R[X_i : i \in \sigma]$, the $R$-algebra map determined by $X_i \mapsto X_i^{p}$ for every $i \in \sigma$, and regard the polynomial ring as an algebra over itself through the underlying ring homomorphism of this map. The assertion is the conjunction of three statements: this ring homomorphism is finite, i.e. the target is a finitely generated module over the source; it is flat, i.e. the target is a flat module over the source; and for every point $q$ of $\operatorname{Spec}(R[X_i : i \in \sigma])$ the local rank `RingHom.finrank` of the homomorphism at $q$ equals $p^{\,\mathrm{Nat.card}\,\sigma}$, where $\mathrm{Nat.card}\,\sigma$ is the number of elements of $\sigma$. No hypothesis on the characteristic of $R$ or on the primality of $p$ is imposed.
--
--   This is the statement that a polynomial ring in $n$ variables is finite and flat of constant rank $p^{n}$ over the subring generated by the $p$-th powers of the variables, the basis being the monomials with all exponents $< p$. It serves as the affine local model for the degree of Frobenius and is used in [`AlgebraicGeometry.SmoothOfRelativeDimension.finrank_eq_pow_of_isPullback_frobenius`](thm.html#AlgebraicGeometry.SmoothOfRelativeDimension.finrank_eq_pow_of_isPullback_frobenius) to compute the rank of the Frobenius of a smooth scheme of relative dimension $n$.
-- source:
--   https://github.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/blob/aa2d8b34692b16c70f699536de0d8e75b9a3e9ef/Theorems/Thm_MvPolynomial_finite_and_flat_and_finrank_expand_eq_pow.lean

import Mathlib

set_option maxHeartbeats 4000000
set_option synthInstance.maxHeartbeats 400000
set_option backward.isDefEq.respectTransparency.types false

set_option autoImplicit false

universe u v

theorem MvPolynomial.finite_and_flat_and_finrank_expand_eq_pow
    (R : Type u) [CommRing R] (σ : Type v) [Finite σ] (p : ℕ) (hp : 0 < p) :
    (MvPolynomial.expand p (σ := σ) (R := R)).toRingHom.Finite ∧
    (MvPolynomial.expand p (σ := σ) (R := R)).toRingHom.Flat ∧
    ∀ q : PrimeSpectrum (MvPolynomial σ R),
      (MvPolynomial.expand p (σ := σ) (R := R)).toRingHom.finrank q = p ^ Nat.card σ := by sorry
